{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01DKmCrHdtAfLmqhQYhfuRkr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Wrote **`02-027-key-tradeoffs-latency-vs-accuracy-chunk-size-vs-context-cost.md`** — the RAG tradeoff triangle answer for Q27. Key content:\n\n- **Tradeoff triangle framework**: latency ↔ accuracy ↔ cost — every lever moves at least two axes simultaneously\n- **Chunk size vs context quality**: small chunks → precise retrieval but broken reasoning; parent-child chunking (256-token child for ANN, 1024-token parent to LLM) resolves the tension without a cost penalty\n- **Latency vs accuracy**: cross-encoder reranker (+80–200 ms) buys +15–25 precision points — highest ROI latency spend; semantic caching (25–30% hit rate) offsets that cost\n- **Cost vs quality**: model tiering (GPT-4o-mini for routine, GPT-4o for escalations) — from $15K/day → <$2K/day at 1M queries/day\n- **Concrete tuning sequence**: baseline → add reranker → parent-child chunking → semantic cache → 84% faithfulness, 0.92s p95, $0.0013/query\n\nNext up: **Q28 — Optimize RAG latency in production**."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":351,"cache_read_input_tokens":61379,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":351,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"799dde9e-1fb2-4502-a827-23adb3035e46","uuid":"3ab4fde0-863b-41f1-8c78-2b48b8f6e0ff"}
